Package: hlaguideR
Type: Package
Title: Design Base-Editing and Cas12a Guides Against HLA Alleles
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yuriy", "Baglaenko", email = "yuriy.baglaenko@cchmc.org",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Enumerates CRISPR protospacers that disrupt splice sites or
    introduce premature termination codons in human leukocyte antigen genes,
    annotates the position of each editable base within every protospacer, and
    summarises off-target searches across a panel of alleles. Guide
    enumeration, splice-site annotation and off-target accounting run in base
    R. The alignment search itself is delegated to an external tool such as
    'Cas-OFFinder' (Bae, Park and Kim, 2014) <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btu048>,
    for which input writers and output parsers are provided.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Suggests: jsonlite, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
